1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,755
Translation preserves truth while
changing the level of detail.

2
00:00:03,825 --> 00:00:07,110
Operators need task consequences and recovery.

3
00:00:07,180 --> 00:00:10,828
Engineers need contracts,
failure modes, and dependencies.

4
00:00:10,898 --> 00:00:15,186
Executives need the decision,
evidence, risk, and next commitment.

5
00:00:15,256 --> 00:00:19,373
Every version should keep the same
authority boundary and uncertainty.

6
00:00:19,443 --> 00:00:22,067
Compress the messy context into one page.

7
00:00:22,137 --> 00:00:27,236
If one audience hears a stronger promise
than another, the translation has changed the

8
00:00:27,306 --> 00:00:29,439
decision rather than clarified it.

9
00:00:29,509 --> 00:00:34,352
The system generates reviewable routing
suggestions using synthetic data.

10
00:00:34,422 --> 00:00:36,555
It has not been approved for production.

11
00:00:36,625 --> 00:00:41,873
That limit must appear in the executive
summary as clearly as in the engineering note.

12
00:00:41,943 --> 00:00:46,722
Pause the video and complete this exercise
before opening the worked response.

13
00:00:46,792 --> 00:00:51,720
Write a three-sentence explanation for
an operator, engineer, and executive.

14
00:00:51,790 --> 00:00:57,593
Operator: review the queue suggestion, override
when needed, and save your choice; use manual

15
00:00:57,663 --> 00:00:59,241
triage if unavailable.

16
00:00:59,311 --> 00:01:05,903
Engineer: the local API validates input, keeps
review separate, and records correlated events;

17
00:01:05,973 --> 00:01:08,064
production controls remain pending.

18
00:01:08,134 --> 00:01:14,683
Executive: the synthetic test supports a bounded
pilot hypothesis; authorize the next access

19
00:01:14,753 --> 00:01:17,377
review rather than claiming customer savings.

20
00:01:17,447 --> 00:01:20,157
What must remain constant across audiences?

21
00:01:20,227 --> 00:01:22,467
A. Every technical detail B.

22
00:01:22,537 --> 00:01:24,691
The facts, limits, and decision C.

23
00:01:24,761 --> 00:01:26,148
The same word count.

24
00:01:26,218 --> 00:01:27,690
The best answer is B.

25
00:01:27,760 --> 00:01:30,555
Compression changes emphasis, not evidence.
